requiredSkills.prompt:
Analyze the following tutorial and identify all the skills that a person would need in order to complete the project. Return as JSON with this structure:

{
  "skills": [
    {
      "name": "Skill name", 
      "level": "Beginner, Intermediate, or Advanced", 
      "description": "Brief description of where/how this skill is needed"
    }
  ],
  "prerequisiteKnowledge": [
    "Background knowledge or familiarity with concepts"
  ],
  "safetyConsiderations": [
    "Any safety considerations or precautions needed"
  ]
}

Return only the JSON. No introductions or explanations.
